00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Chicken Salad. 15 min · 6 servings · American

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ingredients: 12. 3 cups cooked diced chicken; 1/4 cup diced celery; 1/4 cup diced red onion; 1/3 cup diced pepperoncinis

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 1. Mix all ingredients in a large bowl until well combined.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 2. Serve immediately or refrigerate for a few hours.

